# Every Dockerfile in src/*/ builds with the REPO ROOT as context (services
# read RFQ_ROOT-relative paths like identity/, systems/, authorization/,
# business/, agents/, themes/, interfaces/ -- not just their own src/<service>
# dir + rfq_common). This keeps that broad COPY . /app context lean and
# reproducible -- none of the excluded paths are read at runtime by any
# service, only used for local dev/tooling/tests.
.git
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/uv.lock.tmp
tmp
vendor
node_modules
**/node_modules
skills
docs/vendor
data
